# {{APP_NAME}} (iOS)

Generated by AppStudio. Build & deploy to an iPhone WITHOUT a Mac using xtool:

    cd {{PKG_DIR}}
    xtool dev        # build + run on a connected device (developer mode)
    xtool install    # install the built .ipa

Requires: xtool installed + Apple ID auth (`xtool auth`) + device in Developer Mode.

## Architecture & Security
- Assets are served via `WKURLSchemeHandler` at `appstudio://app/index.html` from `Sources/{{SWIFT_NAME}}/Resources/app/`.
- Durable storage (`A-46`): KV data is mirrored atomically into the app's `Application Support/AppStudioStorage/` directory so iOS storage eviction cannot drop app state.
- Encrypted storage (`A-04`): `Bridge.secure_set` / `secure_get` / `secure_remove` use iOS Keychain (`kSecAttrAccessibleAfterFirstUnlockThisDeviceOnly`).
- Deep links / OAuth (`A-53`): Configure `deepLinks` / `auth.redirectScheme` in `studio.json` to emit `CFBundleURLTypes` in `Info.plist` and route `.onOpenURL` callbacks into `App.on_deep_link`.

## Release Packaging
- Build in release mode with `spid3r run studio.matrix build <appdir> --target ios --release`.
- Review `Entitlements.plist` and `sbom.json` before App Store / TestFlight submission.
